        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 29-Z8, Elite Collection Simple Clear Glass Knob With Rope Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSometimes glass knobs can look dated, but not Fusion Hardware's Clear Glass Half-Round Knobset. It's a sophisticated knobset with traditional decor detailing that really elevates it into something glamourous. Easy to install, it will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 5 different finishes for the Rope Rose. The Elite Collection Simple Clear Glass Knob With Rope Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy sets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 29 Z8 Flat Iron Glass Knob with Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Half-Round Glass Knob with Traditional Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clear Glass Half-Round Knobset, Fusion 29-Z8",
                "description": "Fusion 29-Z8, Clear Glass Half-Round Knobset - Sometimes glass knobs can look dated, but not Fusion Hardware's Clear Glass Half-Round Knobset. It's a sophisticated knobset with traditional decor detailing that really elevates it into something glamourous. Easy to install, it will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 5 different finishes for the Rope Rose. The Elite Collection Simple Clear Glass Knob With Rope Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy sets.",
